  "details": "Unfortunately, once the user notes limit has been reached, there is no way to generally reset them. Finding all of these users is also impossible\n\nI use this function for our team event, but I have reached the limit of 2000 and no longer have an effective way to use this function properly.\n\nThere really won't be very many who reach this limit, those who use it will quickly reach the limit and can no longer really use the \"User note\" function.\n\nMaybe a much higher limit for VRC+ users?\n\nor, Increase the limit from 2000 for free?\n\nThe possibility of resetting? \n\nWhether the notes can be viewed on a separate page or \n\njust a button to hard reset all the notes?",
